# COMMUNICATION WORKSPACE RULE

Canonical: `docs/modules/CHAT_WORKSPACE.md`

1. Chat entry: `/seo/{connection_hash}/chat` for Agent + Group Chat
2. Support Ticket is **global client** topbar feature (`ClientCoreServiceProvider`) — not SEO-owned
3. Canonical API: `POST /api/support-tickets` → core DB `support_tickets`
4. Floating global launcher hidden on normal pages
5. Admin `/admin/support-tickets` is temporary **read-only** inspection
6. No ops-server delivery / two-way reply in this phase
7. Group chat = JS client + JSON API; no Livewire poll/render
8. No Telegram/Zalo/WebSocket/generic messaging framework
